Watch your pet!  If they eat it, so can you.  If they will walk on it, 
it is probably safe to try it on.   You can pray for food as long as you 
wait 600 turns or so between prayers.  Identify is the cheapest scroll 
in the shop, costs about 20, He'll offer you about 8 if you drop one in 
a shop.

There are lots of spoilers out there, but experimenting is fun too.

